IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0036.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY CRD0036C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> ASSIGNED CREDIT LIMIT
    05 CREDIT-LIMIT       PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM SET-CARD-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-LIMIT=" CREDIT-LIMIT
    STOP RUN.
SET-CARD-LIMIT.
    IF CREDIT-SCORE >= 750
        COMPUTE CREDIT-LIMIT = ANNUAL-INCOME * 0.30
    *> STANDARD CREDIT LIMIT
    ELSE IF CREDIT-SCORE >= 660
        COMPUTE CREDIT-LIMIT = ANNUAL-INCOME * 0.15
    ELSE
        MOVE 500.00 TO CREDIT-LIMIT
    END-IF
    END-IF.
